#: 50734ccc71a847cbad3ca62a46e7d38c
msgid ""
"To achieve centimeter-level precision in positioning, RTK correction data "
"must be sent to your drone in real time. There are two main methods for "
"delivering this correction data:"
msgstr "要在定位中实现厘米级精度，必须实时向无人机发送 RTK 差分数据。传送差分数据的主要方法有两种："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ardusimple-rtk-gps-simplertk3b-compass.rst:63
#: 242f66efe3d543cb95522cba0acf44c6 3caef7fe4da0406e807a3cfe55f80acb
#: 49d0ad5c5a764e149fb8a1947365bb1b 5a2341c3f96642d58aa0acc9e343e137
#: ac0a585978cb4a4cb568b0e7088c749a
msgid ""
"Using NTRIP correction service:  If you are going to operate in areas with "
"reliable internet connection and NTRIP service coverage, follow `Tutorial on"
" sending NTRIP corrections to ArduPilot. <https://www.ardusimple.com/send-"
"ntrip-corrections-to-ardupilot-with-missionplanner-qgroundcontrol-and-"
"mavproxy/>`_  If you are not aware of NTRIP service provider in your area, "
"we have prepared the `List of RTK correction service providers in your "
"country. <https://www.ardusimple.com/rtk-correction-services-in-your-"
"country/>`_"
msgstr ""
"使用 NTRIP 差分服务：若您将在有可靠互联网连接和 NTRIP 服务覆盖的区域作业，请参阅 `向 ArduPilot 发送 NTRIP "
"差分数据教程。 <https://www.ardusimple.com/send-ntrip-corrections-to-ardupilot-"
"with-missionplanner-qgroundcontrol-and-mavproxy/>`_  若您不了解所在地区的 NTRIP "
"服务提供商，我们已整理了 `您所在国家的 RTK 差分服务提供商列表。 <https://www.ardusimple.com/rtk-"
"correction-services-in-your-country/>`_"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ardusimple-rtk-gps-simplertk3b-compass.rst:64
